i.

1. if size > 5 push 2 nodes from a to b

ii.

2. find btarget (biggest int thats smaller than current - else, biggest value in b)

3. do we need rx or rrx? (check if top half or bottom half)

4. if both are same half, optimize with rr or rrr

5. save score, repeat and execute lowest then push

iii.

6. sort three

iv.

7. find atarget (smallest int thats bigger than current - else, smallest value in a)

8. do we need rx or rrx? (check if top half or bottom half)

9. push, repeat til all is in stack a.

v.

10. find which half minimum value is in to determine if ra or rra.

11. rotate until min value is at the top

